---
import KAJLayout from '../../layouts/KAJLayout.astro';
import Medical3DVector from '../../components/Medical3DVector.astro';
---

<KAJLayout 
  title="KMKI Wilayah KAJ - Komunitas Medik Katolik Indonesia Keuskupan Agung Jakarta"
  description="Portal resmi KMKI Wilayah Keuskupan Agung Jakarta (KAJ). Wadah perhimpunan profesi dan pelayanan kasih tenaga medis Katolik di DKI Jakarta, Tangerang, dan Bekasi. Berakar pada iman, unggul dalam kompetensi medis dan bioetika."
>

  <!-- HERO SECTION: KAJ Standard -->
  <section class="relative pt-10 pb-20 md:pt-16 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50/80 via-white to-slate-50 bg-grid-pattern">
    <!-- 3D Glowing Ambient Orbs -->
    <div class="vibrant-glow-blue w-96 h-96 -top-20 -left-20 opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="vibrant-glow-amber w-[450px] h-[450px] top-1/3 -right-20 opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="vibrant-glow-emerald w-80 h-80 bottom-0 left-1/3 opacity-30"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      
      <!-- Top Announcement Pill -->
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <a 
          href="/ccpg2026" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/95 border border-sky-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-xs hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-md transition group backdrop-blur-xs"
        >
          <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-amber-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-amber-500"></span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sky-700 font-bold">Event Akbar KMKI KAJ:</span>
          <span class="text-slate-600 font-medium hidden sm:inline">Simposium Ilmiah 9th #CCPG2026 (7-8 Nov 2026) di RS Carolus</span>
          <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition">&rarr; Info & Pendaftaran</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline & Intro -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border border-sky-200">
            Wilayah Keuskupan Agung Jakarta
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">DKI Jakarta • Tangerang • Bekasi</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6 font-heading">
          Melayani dengan <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 via-blue-700 to-indigo-800">Kasih Kristiani</span>, Berpadu dalam <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-amber-700">Kompetensi Medis</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Wadah perhimpunan profesi bagi para dokter umum, dokter spesialis, residen, dokter gigi, dan tenaga medis Katolik di wilayah pastoral Keuskupan Agung Jakarta. Bersaksi melalui pelayanan kesehatan yang berakar pada iman, unggul dalam ilmu klinis, dan teguh pada keluhuran bioetika Gereja.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Action Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="#keanggotaan" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-bold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 via-sky-700 to-blue-800 hover:from-sky-500 hover:to-blue-700 shadow-xl shadow-sky-600/25 hover:shadow-sky-600/35 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <line x1="20" y1="8" x2="20" y2="14"/>
              <line x1="23" y1="11" x2="17" y2="11"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Daftar Anggota KMKI KAJ</span>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="/ccpg2026" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-bold text-slate-900 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-amber-500 hover:from-amber-300 hover:to-amber-400 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <span>🎓</span>
            <span>Simposium CCPG 2026</span>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#kegiatan" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Program & Pelayanan</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Visual Card with Official Logo & Badges -->
      <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-8">
        <!-- Floating 3D Graphic Elements -->
        <div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 z-20 hidden md:block">
          <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 border border-white">
            <Medical3DVector name="cross-asclepius" size={46} />
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">4 Pilar Medik Katolik</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Fides • Scientia • Compassio • Mores</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 z-20 hidden md:block">
          <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 border border-white">
            <Medical3DVector name="award-skp" size={46} />
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Continuous Medical Education</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Simposium & SKP Resmi Kemenkes RI</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Banner Card -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white bg-slate-900 relative">
          <img 
            src="/images/header.jpg" 
            alt="KMKI KAJ - Spiritualitas dan Kedokteran Katolik" 
            class="w-full h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 object-cover object-center opacity-85 hover:scale-102 transition duration-700"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/50 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-6 sm:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-full border-2 border-amber-400 bg-white p-1 shadow-md shrink-0">
                <img src="/images/assets_extracted/clean/logo-kmki-kaj.png" alt="Logo KMKI KAJ" class="w-full h-full object-contain rounded-full" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">Komunitas Medik Katolik Indonesia</span>
                <p class="text-white text-base sm:text-2xl font-black font-heading">Wilayah Keuskupan Agung Jakarta</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
              Mewadahi dokter dan tenaga kesehatan Katolik di 68 paroki dan 9 dekenat se-KAJ dalam semangat persaudaraan Injili, pengabdian karitatif, dan pengembangan keprofesian berkelanjutan.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Metrics Ribbon: 4 Key Facts -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-12">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-700 shrink-0">
              <Medical3DVector name="hospital" size={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading">68+</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Paroki di 9 Dekenat KAJ</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-700 shrink-0">
              <Medical3DVector name="stethoscope-ai" size={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading">1.000+</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Dokter & Nakes Katolik</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 shrink-0">
              <Medical3DVector name="shield-check" size={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading">2 RS</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Mitra: Carolus & Atma Jaya</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-700 shrink-0">
              <Medical3DVector name="award-skp" size={28} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 font-heading">9th CPG</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Simposium Nasional 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: TENTANG KAMI & 4 PILAR -->
  <section id="tentang" class="py-20 bg-white border-y border-slate-200/60">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Tentang KMKI KAJ
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Profil & Identitas Organisasi</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight font-heading">
            Wadah Berbagi, Bertumbuh, dan Bersaksi bagi <span class="text-sky-600">Tenaga Medis Katolik</span> di Ibu Kota
          </h2>

          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Komunitas Medik Katolik Indonesia (KMKI) Wilayah Keuskupan Agung Jakarta merupakan organisasi nirlaba perhimpunan tenaga medis Katolik yang dibentuk sebagai tempat untuk saling berbagi, berkomunikasi, dan bersinergi dalam melayani Gereja dan masyarakat luas.
          </p>

          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            Mencakup wilayah DKI Jakarta, Tangerang Raya, dan Bekasi, KMKI KAJ membina para dokter dan nakes untuk tidak hanya mengasah ketajaman klinis berbasis sains kedokteran modern, namun juga memperdalam kerohanian serta menjunjung tinggi ajaran moral dan bioetika Katolik di tengah dinamika tantangan zaman.
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-sky-50 border border-sky-100 flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xs shrink-0 text-sky-600">
              <Medical3DVector name="cross-asclepius" size={32} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Afiliasi Pastoral Komisi Kesehatan</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                KMKI KAJ berkarya selaras dengan arah dasar pastoral Keuskupan Agung Jakarta (KAJ) serta berkoordinasi erat dengan Komisi Kesehatan Konferensi Waligereja Indonesia (KWI).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/30 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 font-heading flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>4 Pilar Medik Katolik</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-sky-600 bg-sky-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Landasan Pelayanan</span>
            </h3>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <!-- Pilar 1: Fides -->
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/70 shadow-xs flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-700 font-bold shrink-0 text-sm">
                  01
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>Fides (Iman)</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-sky-700 bg-sky-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Spiritualitas</span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Menghidupi panggilan profesi sebagai rekan sekerja Kristus Sang Tabib Agung, memperdalam doa dan Ekaristi dalam menjalankan tugas penyembuhan sehari-hari.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Pilar 2: Scientia -->
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/70 shadow-xs flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-700 font-bold shrink-0 text-sm">
                  02
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>Scientia (Ilmu Klinis Mutakhir)</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">EBM & CME</span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Menjaga kompetensi medis berstandar Evidence-Based Medicine (EBM), precision medicine, pemanfaatan teknologi klinis, dan pembelajaran keprofesian berkelanjutan.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Pilar 3: Compassio -->
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/70 shadow-xs flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 font-bold shrink-0 text-sm">
                  03
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>Compassio (Belarasa Kasih)</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Karitatif</span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Menghadirkan kelembutan hati dan kerahiman Allah bagi orang sakit, lansia, fakir miskin, dan kelompok rentan di paroki maupun wilayah pelosok.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Pilar 4: Mores -->
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/70 shadow-xs flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-700 font-bold shrink-0 text-sm">
                  04
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>Mores (Bioetika Katolik)</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Integritas Moral</span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Membela kesakralan dan martabat hidup manusia (dignitas humanae) sejak konsepsi awal hingga akhir alami sesuai Magisterium Gereja Katolik.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: VISI & 5 MISI PELAYANAN -->
  <section id="visi-misi" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/60">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border border-sky-200">
          Visi & Misi KAJ
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3 font-heading">
          Arah dan Komitmen Pelayanan di Keuskupan Agung Jakarta
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-base mt-3">
          Pedoman langkah bagi seluruh anggota dan pengurus dalam mengabdi bagi kemuliaan Tuhan dan keselamatan jiwa raga sesama.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visi Card -->
      <div class="mb-12 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-900 via-slate-900 to-sky-950 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="vibrant-glow-blue w-72 h-72 -top-10 -right-10 opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-amber-400 bg-amber-400/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-400/20">
            Visi Utama KMKI Wilayah KAJ
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black mt-4 leading-relaxed font-heading">
            "Menjadi komunitas medik Katolik yang berakar kokoh pada kasih Kristus, unggul dalam pelayanan klinis berstandar tinggi, teguh memegang etika moral kedokteran Katolik, serta aktif berbelarasa bagi sesama di Keuskupan Agung Jakarta."
          </h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 Misi Pelayanan Cards -->
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 font-heading flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600"></span>
        <span>5 Misi Pelayanan KMKI KAJ</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-700 mb-4">
            <Medical3DVector name="award-skp" size={32} />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-sky-600">MISI 01</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-2">Simposium & CME Berkala</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Menyelenggarakan kongres, simposium ilmiah, dan workshop keterampilan klinis terakreditasi Kemenkes RI/IDI secara periodik guna memperbarui keilmuan dokter umum dan spesialis.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-700 mb-4">
            <Medical3DVector name="cross-asclepius" size={32} />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600">MISI 02</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-2">Seminar Etika & Bioetika</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Menyelenggarakan seminar dan forum kajian mendalam tentang masalah-masalah etik-moral kedokteran terkini agar tenaga medis bertindak selaras dengan ajaran moral Gereja Katolik.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 mb-4">
            <Medical3DVector name="heart-pulse" size={32} />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600">MISI 03</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-2">Seminar Awam & Pelayanan Paroki</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Menyediakan edukasi kesehatan masyarakat bagi umat awam di paroki-paroki se-KAJ, bakti sosial pemeriksaan kesehatan, serta pendampingan kesehatan lansia dan keluarga.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-700 mb-4">
            <Medical3DVector name="hospital" size={32} />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-600">MISI 04</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-2">Kegiatan Rohani: Misa & Ziarek</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Mempererat persaudaraan dan penyegaran iman para tenaga medis melalui Perayaan Misa Pesta Santo Lukas (Pelindung Dokter), rekoleksi hening, dan ziarah rekreasi (Ziarek).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-700 mb-4">
            <Medical3DVector name="brain-ai" size={32} />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600">MISI 05</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-2">Publikasi, Info Board & Bursa Nakes</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Mempublikasikan buletin informasi berkala, mengelola Info Board kebutuhan tenaga kesehatan untuk rumah sakit dan klinik Katolik, serta menjalin jejaring dokter Katolik nasional & FIAMC.
          </p>
        </div>

